# Deterministic line endings: LF in every checkout on every platform (Windows contributors included).
# Files already stored with CRLF in the index keep their stored form (git does not rewrite them under text=auto).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
# Vendored third-party code is stored byte-for-byte as its publisher released it: no end-of-line conversion on any platform,
# so the SHA-256 pins in scripts/ci/assertVendoredDependencies.mjs hold on Windows and Linux alike.
*.tgz binary
vendor/sheetjs/LICENSE -text
supabase/functions/_shared/vendor/** -text
